  {
   "index": 7,
   "tag": "p×3",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 361,
   "text": "Some transaction accounts charge monthly account-keeping fees and other fees for things like ATM withdrawals and internet banking.\nThink about your spending habits and choose the account with the lowest fees. For example, if you often use ATMs, choose an account that has low or no ATM fees.\nNot all transaction accounts have fees, so look for a no-fee account.",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
